===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|hár|lang=non}}, {{term|hór|lang=non}}, from {{proto|gem-pro|hauhaz|lang=is}}.

====Adjective====
{{is-adj-01|há|hátt|hærri|hæstur}}

# [[high]]
#: [[múr|Múrinn]] er '''hár'''.
#:: The wall is '''high'''
# [[tall]]
#: Guð minn almáttugur! Þú ert orðinn svo '''hár'''!
#:: My god almighty! You've gotten so '''tall'''!

